### Phase 6: PR Creation
- Commit message: `feat: [feature] (closes #[issue-number])`
- PR body: implementation details, review results, test results

## Skills (Read on demand)

Skills are installed under `.cursor/skills/` (symlink to `skills/`). Cursor does not auto-discover them - read the relevant `SKILL.md` when the scenario applies:

| Scenario | Skill Path |
|----------|------------|
| Before new feature/change | `.cursor/skills/superpowers/brainstorming/SKILL.md` |
| Multi-step implementation planning | `.cursor/skills/superpowers/writing-plans/SKILL.md` |
| Plan execution | `.cursor/skills/superpowers/subagent-driven-development/SKILL.md` |
| Bug / test failure investigation | `.cursor/skills/superpowers/systematic-debugging/SKILL.md` |
| Test design before implementation (High/Medium risk) | `.cursor/skills/project/test-design/SKILL.md` |
| Testing implementation | `.cursor/skills/superpowers/test-driven-development/SKILL.md` |
| Before completion / merge | `.cursor/skills/superpowers/verification-before-completion/SKILL.md` |
| Pre-push quality check | `.cursor/skills/project/quality-check/SKILL.md` |
| Additional-test proposal (mutation / E2E), standalone or via quality-check Step 5 | `.cursor/skills/project/test-recommendation/SKILL.md` |
| Recurring process issue or explicit improvement task | `.cursor/skills/project/self-improvement/SKILL.md` |
| Parallel worktree development | `.cursor/skills/project/worktree-parallel/SKILL.md` |

Other project skills (server-startup, branch-workflow, backend/frontend-development, database-migration, `lint-scaffolding` (wire deterministic checks (lint/static analysis) and maintain the coverage map), browser-agent, feature-documentation, log-design, generate-docs, implementation-report) live under `.cursor/skills/project/`.

